{"ref":"BDB, מַעְגָּל²","hw":"מַעְגָּל²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְגָּל</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:12\" href=\"/Psalms.65.12\">ψ 65:12</a></sup> <strong>1. entrenchment</strong>; <strong>2. track</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.5\">1 S 26:5</a> +, c. ה loc. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמַּעְגָּ֫לָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.20\">17:20</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְגַּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.26\">Pr 4:26</a> +; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְגְּלֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 23:3\" href=\"/Psalms.23.3\">ψ 23:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.11\">Pr 4:11</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְגָּלֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:12\" href=\"/Psalms.65.12\">ψ 65:12</a>, elsewhere <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְגְּלוֹתֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:5\" href=\"/Psalms.17.5\">17:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְגְּלֹתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.21\">Pr 5:21</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">תֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.12\">2:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.6\">5:6</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">תָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.15\">2:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.8\">Is 59:8</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>circumvallation, entrenchment</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.20\">1 S 17:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.5\">26:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.7\">7</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>track</em> (proposes <em>wagon</em>-track), only fig.: <strong>a.</strong>  in fig. of snares of wicked <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:6\" href=\"/Psalms.140.6\">ψ 140:6</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  = course of action, or life, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ רַגְלֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.26\">Pr 4:26</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.21\">5:21</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּרְכֵי־אִישׁ</span>); specif. good, right, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ צֶדֶק</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 23:3\" href=\"/Psalms.23.3\">ψ 23:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ ישֶׁר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.11\">Pr 4:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ טוֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.9\">2:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ צַדִּיק</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.7\">Is 26:7</a>; bad sense <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.15\">Pr 2:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.6\">5:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.8\">Is 59:8</a>; <em>tracks</em> of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> are those approved by him <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:5\" href=\"/Psalms.17.5\">ψ 17:5</a>; or those traversed by him, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְגָּלֶיךָ יִרְעֲפוּן דָּ֑שֶׁן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:12\" href=\"/Psalms.65.12\">65:12</a> fig. of richly-laden cart dropping its contents in its track.","next":"BDB, עָגַם","prev":"BDB, עֶגְלַ֫יִם"}